## android/README.md (build signed APK)

Steps to produce a signed APK (short):
1. Install Android Studio and configure SDK + ANDROID_HOME.
2. In `android/` run: `./gradlew assembleRelease` (Linux/Mac) or `gradlew assembleRelease` (Windows).
3. The unsigned APK will be in `android/app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release-unsigned.apk`.
4. Create a keystore and sign: `jarsigner` or use Android Studio's Build > Generate Signed Bundle / APK.
5. Zipalign and verify: `zipalign -v -p 4 input.apk output.apk`.

